            </note>
            <note corresp="#d271-f2" n="2" xml:id="d271-f2-content">
                <p>This discussion took place at the State-JCS
                    meeting of Sept. 8, <ref target="#pg492">p. 492</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d271-f3" n="3" xml:id="d271-f3-content">
                <p>JCS 918515, dated Sept. 15, was not attached to
                    the source text; a copy of the text can be found in Matthews files, lot 53 D 413.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
